{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>And I will send against you.</b> From the root of הנני משליח בך:" "<b>And it will bereave you.</b> By killing the young." "<b>And it will reduce you.</b> By killing the adults." "<b>And your roads shall be desolate.</b> For no road is safe, out of fear of the beasts that are not under human control, as I explained."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:12:43.236498409Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}